# Deploy to production after changes

When the user asks you to implement, fix, or change something in this project, **finish by deploying to production** without waiting to be asked.

## What to deploy

| Changed area | Command (from repo root) |
|--------------|---------------------------|
| Static site (`*.html`, assets) | `vercel deploy --prod --yes` |
| Edge Function (`supabase/functions/**`) | `supabase functions deploy generate-image --no-verify-jwt --project-ref mlrhoqapzmmjvtevclkf` |
| DB schema / migrations | Apply via Supabase (SQL Editor or `supabase db push` if migrations exist) |

Deploy only what actually changed. If both frontend and Edge Function changed, run both.

## After deploy

Briefly tell the user what was deployed and the production URL: https://api-kappa-dusky-81.vercel.app

Do not skip deploy because the change seems small.
